uations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership, sometimes not good at taking criticism, can be unorganized. C's 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions. So we maintain vote for C. Provide METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
